# Intentionally empty.
#
# Previously: /*    /index.html   200  (SPA-fallback)
# That caused soft 404s — every unknown URL returned 200 with the homepage,
# which is bad for SEO and confused crawlers.
#
# Now: prerender produces dist/<route>/index.html for every known route AND
# dist/404.html for unknown routes. Netlify's file-based routing handles
# known routes, and Netlify auto-serves 404.html with HTTP 404 status for
# anything else.
